+        """Cumulative funding return of a position opened at Open[i], per bar i..xb (as a fraction of the entry
+        notional). Settlements are scaled by price / entry price (notional moves with the price). A long PAYS
+        positive funding, a short RECEIVES it. The exit bar's settlement counts only if the exit is at its Close."""
+        if self.FT is None or side not in self.fund_sides:
